   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/GensHannanMachinations.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "en": "You've gone back on a deal with Gens Hannan, and they work behind the scenesto damage your standing with the Persean League, and worse.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/GensHannanMachinations.class"
