  {
   "i": 151,
   "en": "the command of a ship.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/PromoteOfficerIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 152,
   "en": "Fees paid to the Sindrian Diktat in exchange for their refraining from interfering in your fuel production business. From orbit.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SindrianDiktatFuelDeal$1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 153,
   "en": "Sindrian Diktat",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SindrianDiktatFuelDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 154,
   "en": "Sindrian Diktat Fuel Accord",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SindrianDiktatFuelDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 155,
   "en": "Sindrian Diktat fuel accord fees",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SindrianDiktatFuelDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 156,
   "en": "The terms of the agreement are so onerous that your reputation at large would not suffer for unilaterally breaking it, though your standing with the Sindrian Diktat specifically would of course be affected.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SindrianDiktatFuelDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 157,
   "en": "You are no longer abiding by your agreement with the Sindrian Diktat.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SindrianDiktatFuelDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 158,
   "en": "You can end this agreement, but there would be no possibility of re-negotiating a similar one in the future.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SindrianDiktatFuelDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 159,
   "en": "You've made an agreement with the Sindrian Diktat, paying a sizeable fee, %s of your gross fuel exports, in exchange for them not bombarding your fuel production facilities from orbit.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SindrianDiktatFuelDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 160,
   "en": " have posted a reward for completing a full survey of ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SurveyPlanetMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 161,
   "en": ", faction: ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SurveyPlanetMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 162,
   "en": "Survey ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SurveyPlanetMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 163,
   "en": " currently hostile to:",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SystemBountyIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 164,
