   "en": " not currently hostile to any major factions.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SystemBountyIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 168,
   "en": "%s authorities ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SystemBountyIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 169,
   "en": "%s commercial concerns ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SystemBountyIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 170,
   "en": "Ending bounty at market [%s]",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SystemBountyIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 171,
   "en": "Likely triggered by %s activity.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SystemBountyIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 172,
   "en": "Payment depends on the number and size of ships destroyed. Standing with ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SystemBountyIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 173,
   "en": "Starting bounty at market [%s], %d credits per frigate",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SystemBountyIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 174,
   "en": "System Bounty",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SystemBountyIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 175,
   "en": "System Bounty - ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SystemBountyIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 176,
   "en": "The bounty stipulates that trade fleets are an exception - attacking them will not result in a reward, regardless of their faction.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SystemBountyIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 177,
   "en": "Triggered by the presence of Commerce on one of your colonies in-system, and by the level of hostile activity.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SystemBountyIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 178,
   "en": "hostile fleets ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SystemBountyIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 179,
   "en": "in or near the ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SystemBountyIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 180,
   "en": "near ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/SystemBountyIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 181,
   "en": " colonies receive %s accessibility",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/TriTachyonDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 182,
   "en": "A partnership with the %s that allows you to leverage your combined market power for mutual benefit.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/TriTachyonDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 183,
   "en": "Dissolved",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/TriTachyonDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 184,
   "en": "Each partner's accessibility bonus is based on the total size of the colonies of the other partner.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/TriTachyonDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 185,
   "en": "End the partnership",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/TriTachyonDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 186,
   "en": "Strategic partnership with ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/TriTachyonDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 187,
   "en": "The contract is carefully worded to survive even in the face of open hostilities, and is, from a legal perspective, perpetually binding.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/TriTachyonDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 188,
   "en": "Tri-Tachyon Strategic Partnership",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/TriTachyonDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 189,
   "en": "You can decide to end this partnership unilaterally, but taking this action would hurt your standing with %s, and there would be no possibility of re-negotiating a similar deal after displaying such a lack of respect for your contractual obligations.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/TriTachyonDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 190,
   "en": "You can of course decide to end this partnership unilaterally, but there would be no possibility of re-negotiating a similar deal after displaying such a lack of respect for your contractual obligations.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/TriTachyonDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 191,
   "en": "Your agreement with the Tri-Tachyon Corporation is no longer in force.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/TriTachyonDeal.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 192,
   "en": "The total price is %s. You have %s available.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/BaseGetCommodityBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 193,
   "en": "You don't have enough credits.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/BaseGetCommodityBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 194,
   "en": "Your fleet's cargo holds are currently full.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/BaseGetCommodityBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 195,
   "en": "Your fleet's crew berths are currently full.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/BaseGetCommodityBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 196,
   "en": "Your fleet's crew quarters can accommodate an additional %s personnel.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/BaseGetCommodityBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 197,
   "en": "Your fleet's fuel tanks are currently full.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/BaseGetCommodityBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 198,
   "en": "Your fleet's fuel tanks can hold an additional %s units of fuel.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/BaseGetCommodityBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 199,
   "en": "Your fleet's holds can accommodate an additional %s units of cargo.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/BaseGetCommodityBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 200,
   "en": " goes on to explain that %s per unit would be necessary for ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/CorruptPLClerkSuppliesBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 201,
   "en": " in the port authority uniform is discreetely trying to catch your eye.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/CorruptPLClerkSuppliesBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 202,
   "en": " looks around, then back at you,",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/CorruptPLClerkSuppliesBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 203,
   "en": " says.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/CorruptPLClerkSuppliesBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 204,
   "en": " to the TriAnon account provided",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/CorruptPLClerkSuppliesBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 205,
   "en": " trouble, \"Think of it as a commission,\" ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/CorruptPLClerkSuppliesBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 206,
   "en": " with a sly smile. \"Strictly off-the-books, of course. This job does allow me to, ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/CorruptPLClerkSuppliesBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 207,
   "en": "Accept and transfer ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/CorruptPLClerkSuppliesBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 208,
   "en": "Decline, explaining that you don't wish to meddle in League affairs",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/CorruptPLClerkSuppliesBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 209,
   "en": "Even a generous stock of %s supplies might go missing. \"It's earmarked, of course, ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/CorruptPLClerkSuppliesBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 210,
   "en": "Talk to the port authority official",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/CorruptPLClerkSuppliesBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 211,
   "en": "The port clerk speaks broadly about how cargo goes missing all the time. ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/CorruptPLClerkSuppliesBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 212,
   "en": "They can afford replacements on the open market, surely.\" ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/CorruptPLClerkSuppliesBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 213,
   "en": "You leave the bar to find a message ping on your TriPad from the local port authority. It seems you've left %s of your supplies in cargo bay twelve, and the bay needs to be cleared out by the end of the next work-shift.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/CorruptPLClerkSuppliesBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 214,
   "en": "You relent and sit with the port clerk who smiles and offers to buy you a drink. \"I'm familiar with your cargo manifest, of course, and thought you might be interested in an opportunity.\" ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/CorruptPLClerkSuppliesBarEvent.class"
  }
 ]
